WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.367
So, here at "Late Night," every
night I deliver a monologue

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.234
made up of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:07.868
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.033
that, due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:11.701
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:13.868
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.367
So we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.467
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:20.000
♪♪

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:24.167
Hey, everybody,
these are two of our writers.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.334
That's Amber.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.667
And that's Jenny.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.834
-I'm Black.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.167
-And I'm gay.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.667
-And we're both women.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:31.968
-And I am not.

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.300
So, here's how this work.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.300
I will read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.300
and Amber and Jenny will read
the punch line.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.734
So, here we go.

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:42.000
Kim Jong-Un has reportedly
banned citizens in North Korea

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.667
from wearing leather jackets.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.767
-Lesbians are calling it
a human rights violation.

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:49.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:51.601
-February is
Black History Month.

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:53.934
-Offer not valid in Virginia.

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:55.968
[ Laughter and groaning ]

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.000
It's not.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.567
-A theater in Portland recently
hosted the opening

00:01:01.567 --> 00:01:03.901
of the world's first
lesbian opera.

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:05.968
-A lesbian opera is like
a regular opera,

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.467
except it's not over
till the cat lady sings.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.300
[ Laughter and groaning ]

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:14.334
-It's a cat crowd.
I should have told you guys.

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:17.334
Heavy cat crowd tonight.
-Cat crowd!

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:19.667
-I came out here earlier...
[ Laughing ]

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.033
...and I was like,
"David Letterman is here,"

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:22.868
and they're like, "Oh, there
gonna be cat stuff?!"

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:24.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.968 --> 00:01:29.467
A Miami museum has curated
an exhibit

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:32.634
about African American jockeys
called "Too Black, Too Fast."

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:36.300
-It's named after the reason
cops give for pulling me over.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.767
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:38.767
-Amber!

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:40.267
-Just kidding!

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:42.234
Cops don't give me a reason
for pulling me over.

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:44.067
-Oh, okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:46.067
According to new research,

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:48.901
female dolphins enjoy
lesbian sex.

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:51.734
-While male dolphins enjoy
asking them how it works.

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:52.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:56.400
-Now -- Now, Jenny...
-Mm-hmm?

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.734
-Is "how does sex work?"
the question lesbians get most?

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:03.133
-No, the question we get most
is, "Can you open this jar?"

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:04.133
-Mm.

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.634
Oh! That reminds me.

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.300
-Oh!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.801
-Ah, there you go.
-Alright.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:20.501
Do you want a pickle?

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:22.167
-What do you think?
-Oh, right.

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:23.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.667
This is where...

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.133
-Take this home.

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:33.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.801 --> 00:02:36.467
[ Laughs ]

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.634
-We have so much pickle
on the desk.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:43.634
-You got dressed up and you're
going to stink like pickle

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:46.300
for frickin' David Letterman,
you douche.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:53.834
-It's Jenny's fault for
splashing the jar everywhere.

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:55.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.100
Philadelphia has unveiled
a new Harriet Tubman statue

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.534
that will only be on display
temporarily.

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.367
-So catch her before she's gone,

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:08.033
said slave owners.

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:09.934
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.901
[ Laughing ] She's --
She's fine with that joke.

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:14.901
-Yeah.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:17.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:20.501
An angry neighbor sent a lesbian
couple in Massachusetts a letter

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:22.534
complaining about
the couple's pride flag.

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:24.400
-And then the lesbians
sent one back

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:27.067
complaining about the neighbor's
poorly built deck.

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:28.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:29.634
-Now, Jenny, are you handy?

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:32.133
-Yes, but never
on the first date.

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:34.100
[ Audience cheering ]

00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:40.601
-An all-Black group is planning
to climb Mount Everest.

00:03:40.601 --> 00:03:42.267
-Which is just
a fancy way of saying

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:45.234
they're going to try to vote
in Texas.

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:49.234
-Now, Amber, why don't more
Black people climb mountains?

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:51.434
-We're just trying to let
white people have something.

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:54.100
-Thank you.
-You climb the mountains.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.400
-The new reboot of
"Sex and the City" features

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.100
several queer characters.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.334
-Also featuring several
queer characters --

00:04:00.334 --> 00:04:02.834
your food co-op.

00:04:02.834 --> 00:04:06.400
-Two Black queer women recently
opened a new lesbian bar

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.234
in Chicago.
-[Together] And we're --

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:10.734
-Jenny, this is a Black joke.

00:04:10.734 --> 00:04:12.234
-Amber, this is a lesbian joke.

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:13.400
-Black joke!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.567
-Lesbian joke!
-Ohh!

00:04:15.567 --> 00:04:18.901
Looks like it's time
for a quick draw!

00:04:18.901 --> 00:04:20.567
Two Black queer women
recently opened

00:04:20.567 --> 00:04:21.901
a new lesbian bar
in Chicago.

00:04:21.901 --> 00:04:23.567
-And you know
they're serving Busch.

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:25.901
-"We're doing shots,"
said the police.

00:04:25.901 --> 00:04:28.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:30.234
Seth.

00:04:30.234 --> 00:04:33.734
Seth, buddy, which one of those
jokes did you like better?

00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:36.367
-When asked to choose
between a Black writer

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:38.200
and a lesbian writer,
I choose not to.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.667
-Oh, smart.
-Mm.

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:41.667
Hey, Seth, why don't you
tell a joke?

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:43.834
-Oh, no, guys, I couldn't.
-Come on, just one.

00:04:43.834 --> 00:04:45.501
-I don't feel like
it will end well.

00:04:45.501 --> 00:04:47.100
-Oh, come on. Do it!

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.267
-Okay, okay.

00:04:50.267 --> 00:04:52.734
The Chicago Bulls recently
celebrated Pride Night

00:04:52.734 --> 00:04:54.367
with a halftime
drag performance.

00:04:54.367 --> 00:04:56.701
"Boo!
Get back to the basketball!"

00:04:56.701 --> 00:04:57.868
said lesbians.

00:04:57.868 --> 00:04:58.868
-[ Gasps ]

00:04:58.868 --> 00:05:00.434
How dare you?

00:05:00.434 --> 00:05:02.267
-You told me it would be okay!

00:05:02.267 --> 00:05:04.767
-You should be ashamed
of yourself.

00:05:04.767 --> 00:05:07.100
-Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.634
♪♪

